Event name: NYE Mayfair Masquerade Ball 2026

Date: Wednesday, 31 December 2026

Venue: The Londoner Hotel, Leicester Square
Address: 50 Whitcomb Street, Leicester Square, London, United Kingdom
Postcode: WC2H 7BA
Nearest tube station: Leicester Square (Northern and Piccadilly lines), 2 minutes' walk

Doors open: 7:00pm (dinner guests)
Dinner served from: 8:15pm. Dinner guests should be seated by 8:00pm; arrivals after 8:10pm will miss some courses.
After-party entry opens: 9:30pm
Last entry: 11:55pm, strictly enforced, no exceptions
Last drinks: 2:00am
Event closes: 2:30am

Capacity: 700 guests total, across two floors (the Ballroom and the Gallery; no access to the hotel rooftop). 360 dinner guests, 340 after-party guests.
Table size: each table seats 12 guests. Bookings for fewer than 12 guests share a table with other guests of the same ticket tier.

Ticket tiers:

1. Silver Dinner & Party ticket
Price per person: £425
Price for 2 guests: £830
Price for a table of 12 guests: £4,980
Includes: two glasses of Moet and Chandon champagne and hot and cold canapes on arrival from 7:00pm; three-course gala dinner in the Ballroom served from 8:15pm; free-flowing house red and white wine during dinner until dessert; unlimited still and sparkling water; live band (The Bando), DJ sets and live performances; Big Ben midnight countdown on 4x6 metre LED screens; midnight snacks; party until 2:30am.

2. Gold Dinner & Party ticket
Price per person: £575
Price for 2 guests: £1,130
Price for a table of 12 guests: £6,720
Includes everything in the Silver tier, plus: premium Ballroom seating closer to the dancefloor; full table waiter drinks service during dinner; complimentary champagne, beer, and premium red and white wine during dinner until dessert.

3. Platinum Dinner & Party ticket
Price per person: £625
Price for 2 guests: £1,230
Price for a table of 12 guests: £7,260
Includes everything in the Gold tier, plus: the best seating positions in the Ballroom, closest to the dancefloor and the stage.

4. After Party Only ticket
Price: £145 per person
Includes: entry from 9:30pm, last entry strictly 11:55pm; a glass of sparkling wine on arrival; access to the Ballroom and The Gallery; live DJs and the Big Ben midnight countdown on 4x6 metre LED screens; midnight snacks; unlimited still and sparkling water; party until 2:30am.
Does not include: dinner, dinner wine, or the champagne reception.

Additional ticket: Young Adult ticket (up to 13 years old)
Price: £345 per person
Includes: four hot and cold canapes on arrival; three-course seasonal menu in the Ballroom; free-flowing juices and soft drinks during dinner; midnight snacks; unlimited still and sparkling water; seated at the same table as their parents or guardians.

Dress code: Black tie or smart evening wear for men; cocktail dress or evening gown for women. No sportswear or trainers. Dress code is enforced at the door. Masks are encouraged but not required; available to purchase on arrival from £15 to £50.

Minimum age: the event is primarily an 18+ event. Valid ID is required on the door. Attendance by younger guests is permitted only by prior arrangement with the organiser by email. Separately, a Young Adult ticket is sold for guests up to 13 years old who are seated with a parent or guardian, so families with children may attend by prior arrangement.

Booking: advance booking only, no tickets sold at the door, no waitlist.
Booking URL: https://www.newyearsevelondon.co.uk/collections/new-years-eve-at-the-londoner-2026

Refunds: all ticket sales are final and non-refundable. Tickets may be transferred to another guest by emailing the order ID and new guest's name to support@newyearsevelondon.co.uk.

Contact email: support@newyearsevelondon.co.uk
Contact phone: +44 7956 900 373